00:58:41.380 --> 00:58:43.740
But that's going
into some weeds.

00:58:46.770 --> 00:58:48.250
So there are
encryption standards.

00:58:48.250 --> 00:58:51.150
And there are also things that
are privacy standards that one

00:58:51.150 --> 00:58:54.327
can do eventual openness.

00:58:54.327 --> 00:58:56.160
So I didn't mention in
the registry service,

00:58:56.160 --> 00:58:58.500
if I want to register
my designs in advance,

00:58:58.500 --> 00:59:00.390
have a clear
