00:59:00.390 --> 00:59:01.830
but I'm worried
about competition

00:59:01.830 --> 00:59:05.610
from other people in the field,
I can embargo my registration.

00:59:05.610 --> 00:59:06.810
So I register.

00:59:06.810 --> 00:59:08.940
It will become available
sometime in the next four

00:59:08.940 --> 00:59:11.220
years, whatever date
I select, but it

00:59:11.220 --> 00:59:14.280
can stay private until that
time so that I can still

00:59:14.280 --> 00:59:16.899
show I did register
this in advance,

00:59:16.899 --> 00:59:18.690
but still have the
value of a registry that

00:59:18.690 --> 00:59:20.220
makes it available over time.

00:59:20.220 --> 00:59:23.130
So it's really trying to be
sensitive to the community

00:59:23.130 --> 00:59:27.210
as it exists now and make
it super easy to transition

00:59:27.210 --> 00:59:30.150
in different ways, depending
on how the issues of openness

00:59:30.150 --> 00:59:31.446
evolve.

00:59:31.446 --> 00:59:32.820
Thank you very
much for the time.

00:59:32.820 --> 00:59:33.420
Appreciate it.

